1
00:00:42,840 --> 00:00:45,159
I know this news is sudden

2
00:00:47,439 --> 00:00:49,039
Your feelings must be more complicated than mine

3
00:00:50,079 --> 00:00:51,439
But no matter what

4
00:00:52,600 --> 00:00:54,479
He's still your own flesh and blood

5
00:00:59,759 --> 00:01:01,799
I haven't taken care of him for over 20 years

6
00:01:02,359 --> 00:01:03,759
What right do I have now?

7
00:01:05,920 --> 00:01:08,599
At least you can give him a choice

8
00:01:12,799 --> 00:01:14,519
But once I take this step

9
00:01:16,040 --> 00:01:17,400
there's really no coming back

10
00:01:20,680 --> 00:01:22,640
They've always wanted me to go back

11
00:01:22,640 --> 00:01:23,640
to take charge

12
00:01:23,640 --> 00:01:25,040
to become the Boss

13
00:01:25,799 --> 00:01:27,560
Right now I just want to live out

14
00:01:27,560 --> 00:01:28,879
the rest of my life in peace

15
00:01:29,159 --> 00:01:31,680
I don't want to go back to that world

16
00:01:35,719 --> 00:01:39,079
Right now I just want to stay by your side

17
00:01:39,159 --> 00:01:40,280
and never go anywhere

18
00:01:43,959 --> 00:01:44,760
You won't

19
00:01:45,400 --> 00:01:47,280
You won't walk down that old path again

20
00:01:48,519 --> 00:01:49,560
Now you have me

21
00:01:50,040 --> 00:01:50,920
and the flower shop

22
00:01:53,599 --> 00:01:54,680
I'll wait for you to come home

23
00:02:03,480 --> 00:02:05,319
Brother Qiang

24
00:02:06,159 --> 00:02:06,959
Brother Qiang

25
00:02:45,479 --> 00:02:47,479
I hear your company's been under heavy investigation lately.

26
00:02:48,199 --> 00:02:50,080
So? Can you handle it?

27
00:02:53,599 --> 00:02:54,520
Thanks for the concern.

28
00:02:56,599 --> 00:02:57,719
They're auditing my books,

29
00:02:58,000 --> 00:02:59,159
shutting down my shops,

30
00:02:59,280 --> 00:03:00,599
and now a murder charge.

31
00:03:02,479 --> 00:03:04,080
You do the math.

32
00:03:04,439 --> 00:03:06,280
Can Chen Jiadong find any evidence against you?

33
00:03:07,520 --> 00:03:08,960
Of course not.

34
00:03:09,879 --> 00:03:11,560
All they'll find is garbage.

35
00:03:12,680 --> 00:03:13,879
I'm a law-abiding citizen.

36
00:03:14,879 --> 00:03:16,719
No evidence means no evidence.

37
00:03:20,319 --> 00:03:21,120
He's got nothing.

38
00:03:22,080 --> 00:03:22,879
But I do.

39
00:03:25,919 --> 00:03:28,039
That bitch Zheng Baojiao

40
00:03:28,840 --> 00:03:29,960
gave it to you after all.

41
00:03:33,719 --> 00:03:34,520
Ah Hong.

42
00:03:35,360 --> 00:03:36,520
Don't keep going down the wrong path.

43
00:03:36,960 --> 00:03:37,719
Turn yourself in.

44
00:03:43,120 --> 00:03:45,520
Keep this up and there's no turning back.

45
00:03:46,800 --> 00:03:48,000
Hand over Zihao,

46
00:03:48,000 --> 00:03:48,960
and leave everything to...

47
00:03:49,120 --> 00:03:50,080
Leave it to who?

48
00:03:50,800 --> 00:03:51,560
To you?

49
00:03:54,560 --> 00:03:55,680
I'm not fighting you over it.

50
00:03:56,800 --> 00:03:57,840
The two of us

51
00:03:57,840 --> 00:04:00,120
were doing just fine before you got out.

52
00:04:00,719 --> 00:04:04,080
The moment you got out, everything fell apart.

53
00:04:05,159 --> 00:04:06,479
You want to be Dragon Head?

54
00:04:06,479 --> 00:04:07,199
Fine.

55
00:04:08,360 --> 00:04:09,280
In your next life.

56
00:04:09,919 --> 00:04:11,919
I never wanted to fight you for Dragon Head.

57
00:04:13,039 --> 00:04:14,199
Just hand over Zihao.

58
00:04:14,280 --> 00:04:16,199
Where Zihao is is none of your damn business.

59
00:04:18,279 --> 00:04:19,839
I'm thinking of taking your advice.

60
00:04:20,480 --> 00:04:22,160
Taking Zihao on a trip to Europe.

61
00:04:24,480 --> 00:04:26,319
Zihao's got nothing to do with this.

62
00:04:26,639 --> 00:04:27,600
If you take him away,

63
00:04:27,879 --> 00:04:28,600
his whole life...

64
00:04:28,600 --> 00:04:29,959
How I treat my son

65
00:04:29,959 --> 00:04:31,920
is none of your business, Liang Zhiqiang!

66
00:04:35,600 --> 00:04:36,759
He's not your son.

67
00:04:37,199 --> 00:04:38,360
He's my son.

68
00:04:41,759 --> 00:04:43,160
He's your son?

69
00:04:43,720 --> 00:04:44,879
Twenty years.

70
00:04:45,199 --> 00:04:46,920
I raised him for twenty years.

71
00:04:47,920 --> 00:04:49,120
Where the hell were you?

72
00:04:50,360 --> 00:04:51,360
As long as he bears the Xie name,

73
00:04:51,360 --> 00:04:52,360
he'll bear it his whole life.

74
00:04:52,360 --> 00:04:53,319
He's my son.

75
00:04:53,319 --> 00:04:54,480
You're just a stud.

76
00:04:55,600 --> 00:04:57,319
You ask where I was for twenty years?

77
00:04:57,399 --> 00:04:58,279
Don't you know?

78
00:04:59,560 --> 00:05:00,639
Who were those twenty years for?

79
00:05:00,639 --> 00:05:01,759
Isn't it obvious?

80
00:05:03,079 --> 00:05:04,279
I did twenty years in prison for you.

81
00:05:04,279 --> 00:05:05,600
Not because I'm some great guy.

82
00:05:06,360 --> 00:05:06,879
I want to tell you,

83
00:05:06,879 --> 00:05:08,360
I did it for my own brother.

84
00:05:08,920 --> 00:05:09,680
Ah Hong, you're my brother.

85
00:05:09,680 --> 00:05:10,279
Do you get that?

86
00:05:10,279 --> 00:05:11,560
Don't call me Ah Hong.

87
00:05:11,959 --> 00:05:13,000
Ah Hong is dead.

88
00:05:13,000 --> 00:05:14,439
He died twenty years ago.

89
00:05:14,519 --> 00:05:16,240
You killed him, Liang Zhiqiang.

90
00:05:33,279 --> 00:05:35,680
I'm now the Dragon Head of Heyisheng.

91
00:05:35,959 --> 00:05:38,519
Xie Guanhong.

92
00:05:41,680 --> 00:05:43,680
My good brother Ah Hong is dead.

93
00:05:47,040 --> 00:05:48,439
Then let me offer incense for him.

94
00:06:21,000 --> 00:06:21,920
I'll leave in a bit

95
00:07:32,439 --> 00:07:34,600
Sir, have you seen this person?

96
00:07:34,759 --> 00:07:35,439
No.

97
00:07:35,720 --> 00:07:36,399
No.

98
00:07:37,120 --> 00:07:37,519
Excuse me.

99
00:07:37,519 --> 00:07:38,439
Have you seen this person?

100
00:07:42,360 --> 00:07:43,079
Have you seen him?

101
00:07:43,519 --> 00:07:44,120
Thank you.

102
00:07:52,720 --> 00:07:53,680
Have you seen this person?

103
00:07:54,040 --> 00:07:54,959
No, I haven't.

104
00:07:54,959 --> 00:07:55,879
Take a closer look.

105
00:08:20,600 --> 00:08:21,560
I want to go home

106
00:08:21,839 --> 00:08:22,680
Fine

107
00:08:23,480 --> 00:08:26,120
Go call your damn father

108
00:08:26,279 --> 00:08:27,079
and get me out of here too

109
00:08:28,399 --> 00:08:29,759
Can't you speak a little more politely?

110
00:08:30,680 --> 00:08:31,800
Who the hell are you?

111
00:08:31,800 --> 00:08:33,159
I'm not your mother

112
00:08:33,360 --> 00:08:34,960
I'm under no obligation to coddle you

113
00:08:43,879 --> 00:08:45,559
You'd better behave yourself

114
00:08:45,879 --> 00:08:48,080
Just because I smile at you every day

115
00:08:48,159 --> 00:08:50,679
you really think you're a big shot.

116
00:09:09,919 --> 00:09:12,759
Now that's your dad's good boy.

117
00:09:13,159 --> 00:09:15,159
Have you even seen what's going on out there?

118
00:09:15,159 --> 00:09:16,360
If you just walk out like that,

119
00:09:16,360 --> 00:09:18,000
and you'll be dead in a heartbeat.

120
00:09:18,559 --> 00:09:19,600
Just stay put,

121
00:09:19,600 --> 00:09:20,519
and wait for your dad.

122
00:09:20,519 --> 00:09:21,840
Once he deals with those idiots,

123
00:09:21,960 --> 00:09:23,519
then you can go back out there,

124
00:09:23,519 --> 00:09:25,080
and be the Gang's young master again.

125
00:09:25,440 --> 00:09:26,360
But I don't want to do it anymore.

126
00:09:27,039 --> 00:09:27,919
I've made up my mind.

127
00:09:28,919 --> 00:09:29,960
I can't be the Boss,

128
00:09:30,279 --> 00:09:31,519
and I don't want to be a gangster either.

129
00:09:33,279 --> 00:09:34,840
I just want to live a normal life.

130
00:09:35,639 --> 00:09:36,960
A normal life?

131
00:09:38,879 --> 00:09:40,320
Are you out of your mind?

132
00:09:40,320 --> 00:09:41,360
Your last name is Xie.

133
00:09:41,360 --> 00:09:43,240
And you want a normal life?

134
00:09:43,240 --> 00:09:45,039
Are you an idiot?

135
00:09:45,480 --> 00:09:47,120
What does my last name have to do with it?

136
00:09:48,320 --> 00:09:49,720
I can't choose my last name,

137
00:09:49,919 --> 00:09:51,480
but surely I can choose what I do.

138
00:10:00,440 --> 00:10:01,799
You know,

139
00:10:04,159 --> 00:10:05,360
I thought about leaving too.

140
00:10:10,159 --> 00:10:11,600
But then I figured it out.

141
00:10:15,360 --> 00:10:18,480
Xie Guanhong chose everything for you long ago.

142
00:10:18,679 --> 00:10:20,240
Who's around you,

143
00:10:20,240 --> 00:10:21,440
what clothes you wear,

144
00:10:21,440 --> 00:10:22,279
who you should trust,

145
00:10:22,279 --> 00:10:23,799
which path you should take.

146
00:10:27,039 --> 00:10:28,200
I have no choice.

147
00:10:30,679 --> 00:10:31,799
And neither do you.

148
00:11:06,200 --> 00:11:07,759
Is there anything I can help you with?

149
00:11:15,039 --> 00:11:15,799
Hello

150
00:11:26,399 --> 00:11:27,519
Stop wandering around, will you?

151
00:11:27,519 --> 00:11:28,480
Searching like this is useless.

152
00:11:28,559 --> 00:11:29,840
I know about what happened to Zihao.

153
00:11:30,279 --> 00:11:31,879
A Qiang, trust me, okay?

154
00:11:32,600 --> 00:11:33,320
Excuse me.

155
00:11:33,559 --> 00:11:34,879
Have you seen this boy?

156
00:11:34,879 --> 00:11:35,879
About seventeen or eighteen.

157
00:11:36,840 --> 00:11:37,919
Pretty good-looking, actually.

158
00:11:38,279 --> 00:11:39,080
Have you seen him?

159
00:11:39,200 --> 00:11:40,360
No, I haven't.

160
00:11:40,559 --> 00:11:41,120
Thank you.

161
00:11:41,440 --> 00:11:42,639
I've already requested a traffic search,

162
00:11:42,639 --> 00:11:43,639
and pulled nearby security footage.

163
00:11:43,639 --> 00:11:44,720
We'll find him soon.

164
00:11:44,919 --> 00:11:45,759
Don't worry.

165
00:11:45,759 --> 00:11:47,080
He's old enough, he'll be fine.

166
00:11:48,000 --> 00:11:49,759
Hi, have you seen this boy?

167
00:11:50,120 --> 00:11:51,000
No, I haven't.

168
00:11:51,039 --> 00:11:51,759
Thank you.

169
00:11:51,919 --> 00:11:53,240
A Qiang, just trust me, okay?

170
00:11:53,240 --> 00:11:53,759
I trust you.

171
00:11:53,759 --> 00:11:54,960
I'm a cop.

172
00:11:54,960 --> 00:11:55,960
And I'm your brother too.

173
00:11:57,399 --> 00:11:58,399
Can't you trust me?

174
00:11:58,399 --> 00:11:59,679
I won't let anything happen to him.

175
00:11:59,679 --> 00:12:01,159
Heyisheng is causing chaos out there right now.

176
00:12:01,240 --> 00:12:02,679
If you go out, they'll definitely come after you.

177
00:12:02,679 --> 00:12:03,639
You stay right here.

178
00:12:06,120 --> 00:12:07,200
Are you going back?

179
00:12:08,879 --> 00:12:11,159
I don't want to be Boss anymore.

180
00:12:11,799 --> 00:12:12,879
I know wandering around now

181
00:12:12,879 --> 00:12:13,879
is only causing you trouble.

182
00:12:14,480 --> 00:12:15,600
Zihao is my son.

183
00:12:15,600 --> 00:12:17,039
I can't just not look for him.

184
00:12:17,559 --> 00:12:18,519
I can't wait.

185
00:12:18,519 --> 00:12:19,879
Just trust me, okay?

186
00:12:34,080 --> 00:12:35,360
Liang Zhiqiang

187
00:12:35,759 --> 00:12:37,480
Why are you still looking for my son?
